  AUTHORITY   assembled from definitions/ and targets/
  DEFINITION        TARGET   DEFINITION KINDS  TARGET KINDS         EFFECTIVE   DESTROY OPS
  commands-destroy  local    destroy           read destroy         d           destroy
  not-there         staging  unresolved        read mutate destroy  unresolved  unresolved
  orphan            staging  read              read mutate destroy  r           —
  things            staging  mutate destroy    read mutate destroy  m d         end_thing
  things-observed   staging  read              read mutate destroy  r           —

  FLAGS   index into the gutter above — no flag states anything the gutter does not
